LAMMPS (27 Oct 2021)
clear
units		metal
atom_style spin
dimension	3
boundary	p p p

atom_modify 	map array

variable 	a0 	equal 	2.86649609
variable	vol	equal	${a0}*${a0}*${a0}
variable	vol	equal	2.86649609*${a0}*${a0}
variable	vol	equal	2.86649609*2.86649609*${a0}
variable	vol	equal	2.86649609*2.86649609*2.86649609
variable 	a 	equal  2*${a0}
variable 	a 	equal  2*2.86649609
variable 	n0 	equal  1

lattice custom    1.0             a1      2.8664960900000001 0.0000000000000000 0.0000000000000000             a2      0.0000000000000000 2.8664960900000001 0.0000000000000000             a3      0.0000000000000000 0.0000000000000000 2.8664960900000001              basis        0.00000000        0.00000000        0.00000000       basis 0.50000000        0.50000000        0.50000000
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 2.8664961 2.8664961 2.8664961


region		whole block 0.0 ${n0} 0.0 ${n0} 0.0 ${n0}
region		whole block 0.0 1 0.0 ${n0} 0.0 ${n0}
region		whole block 0.0 1 0.0 1 0.0 ${n0}
region		whole block 0.0 1 0.0 1 0.0 1
create_box	1 whole
Created orthogonal box = (0.0000000 0.0000000 0.0000000) to (2.8664961 2.8664961 2.8664961)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
 change_box all triclinic
Changing box ...
  triclinic box = (0.0000000 0.0000000 0.0000000) to (2.8664961 2.8664961 2.8664961) with tilt (0.0000000 0.0000000 0.0000000)
 change_box all xy final .057329921800 units box
Changing box ...
  triclinic box = (0.0000000 0.0000000 0.0000000) to (2.8664961 2.8664961 2.8664961) with tilt (0.057329922 0.0000000 0.0000000)
create_atoms    1 region   whole            basis   1       1               basis   2       1
Created 2 atoms
  using lattice units in triclinic box = (0.0000000 0.0000000 0.0000000) to (2.8664961 2.8664961 2.8664961) with tilt (0.057329922 0.0000000 0.0000000)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds
mass		1 55.845

group		type1 type 1
2 atoms in group type1

#Define Spins
set 		group type1 spin   2.2 -1.0 1.0 0.0
Setting atom values ...
  2 settings made for spin

#Define Potential
pair_style hybrid/overlay eam/alloy spin/exchange 2.674 spin/neel 2.674
pair_coeff 	* * eam/alloy Fe_Mishin2006.eam.alloy Fe
######## MAGPOT DATA HERE ############
pair_coeff  * * spin/exchange exchange  2.6744772631993072 -0.015938382390086922 2.4370720984331284 2.482458435  offset no
pair_coeff  * * spin/neel neel  2.6744772631993072 0.00038774818264079023 0.8405797101449275 2.482458435 3.102249986870197e-05 1.0498145925771576 2.482458435
######################################

#----
neighbor     0.1 bin
neigh_modify     every 10 check yes delay 20

# compute and output options
fix		1 all nve/spin lattice moving

#--
compute 	out_mag    all spin
compute 	outsp all property/atom spx spy spz sp fmx fmy fmz

variable 	magx      equal c_out_mag[1]
variable 	magy      equal c_out_mag[2]
variable 	magz      equal c_out_mag[3]
variable 	magnorm   equal c_out_mag[4]
#--

thermo_style custom etotal v_magx v_magy v_magz v_magnorm
thermo       1

variable        etotal0   equal etotal
run	0

